hadiths[44]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1828","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Teen giroh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyon key gharon mein aey jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ibaadat key baarey mein poochhtey they. Phir jab unhey khabar di gai to goya unhon-ne use kam samjha. To unhon-ne kaha: Aur ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kahaan hain? Aap key agley aur pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye gaey hain. Un mein se aik ne kaha: Lekin main raat ko hamesha namaz padhunga. Aur doosrey ne kaha: Main hamesha roza rakhunga aur iftaar na karunga. Aur doosrey ne kaha: Main auraton se alag rahunga aur kabhi nikaah na karunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas tashreef laaey aur farmaya: Kya tum wahi ho jinhon-ne aisa aisa kaha? Khabardaar! Allah ki qasam beshak main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darnay wala aur us se sab se zyada parhez karnay wala hun. Lekin main roza rakhta hun aur iftaar karta hun. Aur namaz padhta hun aur sota hun. Aur auraton se nikaah karta hun. To jo meri sunnat se beraghbati karey wo mujh se nahi hai. (Bukhari: 5063)"
"1829","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqaas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Usmaan bin Mazoon ko duniya chhorney se radd kar diya. Aur agar Aap use duniya chhorney ki ijazat detey to ham khassi ho jaatey. (Bukhari: 5074)"
"1830","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main jawaan aadmi hun. Aur main apni jaan par gunaah se darta hun. Aur mujhey wo nahi milta jiskay sath main auraton se nikaah karun. To Aap mujh se khaamosh rahey. Phir main ne waisa kaha aur Aap mujh se khaamosh rahey. Phir main ne waisa kaha aur Aap mujh se khaamosh rahey. Phir main ne waisa kaha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Qalam khushk ho gaya hai jo tum paaney waley ho. To us par khassi ho jao ya chhoro. (Bukhari: 5076)"
"1831","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Bataaiye agar tum waadi mein utro jismein darkht ho jise khaaya gaya hai aur tum darkht paao jise khaaya nahi gaya hai. To tum apne oont ko kismein charaaogey? Aap ne farmaya: Jise charaaya nahi gaya hai. Yaani ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey siwa kunwaari se nikaah nahi kya tha. (Bukhari: 5077). Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne nikaah kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tum ne kya nikaah kya? To main ne kaha: Main ne bewa se nikaah kya hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhey kunwaariyon aur unkey khel se kya kaam. To main ne uska Amr bin Deenaar se zikr kya. To Amr ne kaha: Main ne Jaabir bin Abdullah ko kehtey huey suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kunwaari kyun nahi jo tum us se khelo aur wo tum se kheley. (5080). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1832","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se nikaah ka paighaam bheja. To Abu Bakr ne Aap se kaha: Beshak main tumhaara bhai hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum Allah key deen aur uski Kitaab mein merey bhai ho. Aur wo merey liye halaal hai. (Bukhari: 5081)"
"1833","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Abu Huzaifa bin Utba bin Rabia bin Abd Shams (Raziallahu anhu), jabke wo un mein they jinhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Badr mein haazri di thi, ne Saalim ko beta banaaya tha. Aur uska apne bhai ki beti Hind bint Waleed bin Utba bin Rabia se nikaah kar diya tha. Jabke wo Ansaar ki aurat ka aazaad karda tha. Jaisa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zaid ko beta banaaya tha. Jabke jo jaahiliyat mein aadmi ko beta banaata tha to log use uski taraf bulaatey aur uski meeraas mein waaris hotey. Yahan tak ke Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Unhey unkey baapon ki taraf bulaao) uskey qaul (aur tumhaarey doston) tak. To wo unkey baapon ki taraf lautaaey gaey. Phir jiska baap maloom na hota wo deen mein madadgaar aur bhai tha. To Sahla bint Suhail bin Amr Quraishi phir Aamiri, jo Abu Huzaifa bin Utba ki biwi thein, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaein. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham Saalim ko beta samajhtey they. Jabke Allah ne uskey baarey mein jo tum jaan chukey ho naazil kya hai. To hadees zikr ki. (Bukhari: 5088)"
"1834","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zubair ki beti Zubaa key paas daakhil huey. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Shayed tum ne Hajj ka iraada kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main apne aap ko beemaar key siwa nahi paaten. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Hajj karo aur shart lagaao aur kaho: Ae Allah! Mera khulney ki jagah wahaan hai jahaan tum ne mujhey rok diya. Jabke wo Miqdaad bin Aswad key nikaah mein thein. (Bukhari: 5089)"
"1835","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aurat se chaar key liye nikaah kya jaata hai: Uskey maal key liye aur uskey hasab key liye aur uskey husn key liye aur uskey deen key liye. To deendaar se kaamyaab ho, tumhaarey haath khaak aalood hon! (Bukhari: 5090)"
"1836","[AI-translation] Sahl (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se guzra. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum iskey baarey mein kya kehtey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Laeq hai ke agar wo nikaah ka paighaam bhejey to us se nikaah kya jaey. Aur agar wo sifaarish karey to qabool ki jaey. Aur agar wo kahey to suna jaey. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir Aap khaamosh rahey. To Musalmaanon key faqeeron mein se aadmi guzra. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum iskey baarey mein kya kehtey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Laeq hai ke agar wo nikaah ka paighaam bhejey to us se nikaah na kya jaey. Aur agar wo sifaarish karey to qabool na ki jaey. Aur agar wo kahey to na suna jaey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye zameen bhar us jaisey se behtar hai. (Bukhari: 5091)"
"1837","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne apne baad mardon par auraton se zyada nuqsaan denay wala fitna nahi chhora. (Bukhari: 5096)"
"1838","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya: Kya tum Hamza ki beti se nikaah na karogey? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo doodh key rishtay se merey bhai ki beti hai. (Bukhari: 5100)"
"1839","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Hafsa key ghar mein aadmi ki aawaaz suni jo ijazat maangta tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye aadmi hai jo tumhaarey ghar mein ijazat maangta hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mera khayaal hai ke fulaan hai, Hafsa key doodh key chacha key liye. Aisha ne kaha: Agar fulaan zinda hota, apne doodh key chacha key liye, to kya wo merey paas daakhil hota? To Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Doodh haraam karta hai jo paidaish haraam karti hai. (Bukhari: 5099)"
"1840","[AI-translation] Abu Sufyan ki beti Umm Habeeba (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri behan se nikaah karo jo Abu Sufyan ki beti hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum use pasand kartin ho? To main ne kaha: Haan. Main tumhaarey liye khaali nahi hun. Aur mujhey sab se mehboob jo merey sath bhalai mein shareek ho meri behan hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak wo merey liye halaal nahi hai. Main ne kaha: Beshak ham baat kartey hain ke tum Abu Salma ki beti se nikaah karna chaaahtey ho. Aap ne farmaya: Umm Salma ki beti? Main ne kaha: Haan. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaash wo meri god mein parwarish paaney wali beti na hoti to wo merey liye halaal na hoti. Beshak wo doodh key rishtay se merey bhai ki beti hai. Mujhey aur Abu Salma ko Suwaiba ne doodh pilaaya tha. To mujh par apni betiyon aur apni behnon ko pesh na karo. (Bukhari: 5101)"
"1841","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas daakhil huey jabke unkey paas aadmi tha. To goya Aapka chehra badal gaya, goya Aap ne use naapasand kya. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak wo mera bhai hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Dekho tumhaarey bhai kaun hain. Beshak doodh bhook se hai. (Bukhari: 5102)"
"1842","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke aurat ka uski phuphi ya uski khaala par nikaah kya jaey. (Bukhari: 5108)"
"1843","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne shighaar se mana kya. (Bukhari: 5112)"
"1844","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar key zamaaney mein muta aur paaltu gadhon key gosht se mana kya. (Bukhari: 5115)"
"1845","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aurat ne apne aap ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par pesh kya. To aadmi ne Aap se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujh se uska nikaah kar dijiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumharey paas kya hai? Us ne kaha: Merey paas kuchh nahi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur talaash karo agarchey lohey ki angoothi ho. To wo gaya phir wapas aaya. To us ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam main ne kuchh nahi paaya aur na lohey ki angoothi. Lekin ye mera tehband hai, uskey liye uska aadha hai. Sahl ne kaha: Jabke uski chaadar na thi. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum apne tehband se kya karogey? Agar tum ne use pehna to us par us mein se kuchh na hoga. Aur agar us ne use pehna to tum par us mein se kuchh na hoga. To aadmi baitha raha yahan tak ke jab uski majlis lambi hui to wo utha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use dekha aur use bulaaya. Ya uskey liye bulaaya gaya. To Aap ne us se farmaya: Tumharey paas Quran mein se kya hai? To us ne kaha: Merey paas fulaan surat aur fulaan surat hain, surton ki ginti kartay huey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne use tumhaari milkiyat mein diya jo tumharey paas Quran mein se hai. (Bukhari: 5121)"
"1846","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Sahl Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai ke aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main tumhey apne aap ko tohfey mein denay aai hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski taraf dekha. To Aap ne uski taraf nigaah uthai aur neechi ki. Phir Aap ne apna sar jhuka diya. Aur hadees zikr ki. Aur uskey aakhir mein kaha: Kya tum unhey zubani padhtey ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Jao, main ne use tumhaari milkiyat mein diya jo tumharey paas Quran mein se hai. (Bukhari: 5126)"
"1847","[AI-translation] Maqil bin Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apni behan ka aadmi se nikaah kar diya. To us ne use talaaq di. Yahan tak ke jab uski iddat guzar gai to wo uska nikaah paighaam ley kar aaya. To main ne us se kaha: Main ne tum se nikaah kya aur tumhey bistar diya aur tumhaari izzat ki. To tum ne use talaaq di. Phir tum uska nikaah paighaam ley kar aey ho? Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Wo tumhaari taraf kabhi wapas na aaeygi. Jabke wo aadmi tha jismein harj nahi tha. Aur aurat uski taraf wapas aana chaahti thi. To Allah ne ye aayat naazil farmai: (To unhey na roko). To main ne kaha: Ab karunga Ya Rasulullah! Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne uska us se nikaah kar diya. (Bukhari: 5130)"
"1848","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bewa ka nikaah na kya jaey yahan tak ke us se mashwara kya jaey. Aur kunwaari ka nikaah na kya jaey yahan tak ke us se ijazat li jaey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur uski ijazat kaisi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ke wo khaamosh rahey. (Bukhari: 5136)"
"1849","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak kunwaari sharmaaten hai. Aap ne farmaya: Uski raza uski khaamoshi hai. (Bukhari: 5137)"

"1850","[AI-translation] Khansa bint Khizaam Ansaariya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke uskey waalid ne uska nikaah kya jabke wo bewa thi aur us ne use naapasand kya. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai aur Aap ne uska nikaah radd kar diya. (Bukhari: 5139)"
"1851","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) kehtey they: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke tum mein se koi apne bhai ki be par be karey. Aur aadmi apne bhai key paighaam par paighaam na bhejey yahan tak ke pehla paighaam bhejnay wala chhor dey ya paighaam bhejnay wala use ijazat dey. (Bukhari: 5142)"
"1852","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aurat key liye halaal nahi hai ke wo apni behan ki talaaq maangey taake apna bartan khaali karey. Beshak uskey liye wahi hai jo uskey liye muqaddar kya gaya hai. (Bukhari: 5152)"
"1853","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Ansaar mein se aadmi ki taraf aurat ko dulhan bana kar bheja. To Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Kya tumhaarey paas khel na tha? Beshak Ansaar ko khel achha lagta hai. (Bukhari: 5163). Anas bin Maalik se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Wo hamaarey paas se Bani Rifaa ki masjid mein guzrey aur main ne use kehtey huey suna: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Umm Sulaim key pehluon se guzartey to unkey paas daakhil hotey aur unhey salaam kehtey. Phir unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zainab se dulha they. To Umm Sulaim ne mujh se kaha: Kaash ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tohfa bhejtey. To main ne un se kaha: Karo! To unhon-ne khajoor aur ghee aur paneer ki taraf qasad kya. To unhon-ne handi mein haleem banaaya. To use merey sath Aapki taraf bheja. To main use Aapki taraf ley gaya. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Use rakkho! Phir Aap ne mujhey hukm diya aur farmaya: Merey liye aadmi bulaao, unkey naam liye, aur merey liye jise tum paao bulaao. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne waisa kya jiska Aap ne mujhey hukm diya tha. To main wapas aaya aur ghar walon se bhara tha. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne us haleem par apney haath rakkhey aur uskey sath jo Allah ne chaaha kaha. Phir Aap das das ko bulaaney lagey jo us mein se khaatey aur Aap un se farmaatey: Allah ka naam lo! Aur har aadmi us mein se khaey jo uskey qareeb hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Yahan tak ke wo sab us mein se muntashir ho gaey. To un mein se jo nikla nikla aur giroh baaqi raha jo baat kar raha tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main ghamgeen hua. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hujron ki taraf nikley aur main Aap key peechey nikla. To main ne kaha: Beshak wo chaley gaey hain. To Aap wapas aey aur ghar mein daakhil huey aur parda latka diya. Jabke main hujrey mein hun. Jabke Aap farma rahey hain: (Ae imaan walon! Nabi key gharon mein daakhil na ho magar ye ke tumhey khaaney ki ijazat di jaey, uskey pakney ka intezaar na kartey huey. Lekin jab tumhey bulaaya jaey to daakhil ho. Phir jab tum khaa lo to muntashir ho jao aur baat key liye uns na karo. Beshak ye Nabi ko takleef deta tha aur wo tum se sharmaata tha. Jabke Allah haq se nahi sharmaata). Abu Usmaan ne kaha: Anas ne kaha: Beshak unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki das saal khidmat ki. (5163). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1854","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Agar un mein se koi jab apni biwi key paas aata hai kahey: Allah key naam se! Ae Allah! Mujhey shaitaan se door rakkh aur shaitaan ko us se door rakkh jo tum ne hamein diya hai. Phir un donon key darmiyaan us mein muqaddar kya gaya. Ya beta muqaddar kya gaya. To use shaitaan kabhi nuqsaan na dega. (Bukhari: 5165)"
"1855","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon mein se kisi par utna waleema nahi kya jitna Zainab par waleema kya. Aap ne bakri se waleema kya. (Bukhari: 5168)"
"1856","[AI-translation] Shaiba ki beti Safiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni baaz biwiyon par do mudd jau se waleema kya. (Bukhari: 5172)"
"1857","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi waleemay ki taraf bulaaya jaey to use aana chaahiye. (Bukhari: 5173)"
"1858","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo apne padosi ko takleef na dey. Aur auraton key sath bhalai ki wasiyat karo. Beshak wo pasli se paida ki gaein. Aur beshak pasli mein sab se tedha uska upar hai. Phir agar tum use seedha karney jao to use tod dogey. Aur agar use chhoro to wo tedhi rahegi. To auraton key sath bhalai ki wasiyat karo. (Bukhari: 5186)"
"1859","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Gyaarah auratein baitheen. To unhon-ne ahd aur muaahida kya ke wo apne shoharon ki khabron mein se kuchh na chhupaayengi. Pehli ne kaha: Mera shohar dubli oontni key gosht jaisa hai jo pahaad ki choti par hai. Na aasaan ke us par chadha jaey. Aur na mota ke uthaa kar laaya jaey. Doosri ne kaha: Merey shohar ki khabar main na phailaungi. Beshak mujhey khauf hai ke main use na chhorun. Agar main uska zikr karun to uskey ubhaar aur gireh ka zikr karun. Teesri ne kaha: Mera shohar lamba hai. Agar main bolun to talaaq di jaaun. Aur agar khaamosh rahun to latki rahun. Chauthi ne kaha: Mera shohar Tihaama ki raat jaisa hai. Na garmi aur na sardi. Aur na khauf aur na uktaahat. Paanchween ne kaha: Mera shohar agar daakhil ho to cheeta hai. Aur agar nikley to sher hai. Aur wo uskey baarey mein nahi poochhta jo us ne dekha. Chhati ne kaha: Mera shohar agar khaey to lapettey. Aur agar peey to nichodey. Aur agar letey to simtey. Aur wo haath daakhil nahi karta taake gham jaaney. Saatween ne kaha: Mera shohar naa samaajh ya behosh hai. Har beemaari uskey liye beemaari hai. Tumhaara sar phodey ya tumhey giraaey. Ya tumhaarey liye sab jama karey. Aathween ne kaha: Merey shohar ka chhuna khargosh key chhunay jaisa hai. Aur khushbu zar nab ki khushbu jaisi hai. Nauween ne kaha: Mera shohar unchey sutoon wala hai. Lambi talwaar wala hai. Badi raakh wala hai. Majlis se uska ghar qareeb hai. Dasween ne kaha: Mera shohar Maalik hai. Aur Maalik kya hai? Maalik us se behtar hai. Uskey liye oontniyaan hain jo baithney ki jagah bahut wali hain. Charney ki jagah kam wali hain. Aur jab wo baajay ki aawaaz sunteen hain to yaqeen kartin hain ke wo halaak honay wali hain. Gyaarhween ne kaha: Mera shohar Abu Zara hai. Aur Abu Zara kya hai? Us ne merey kaanon ko zewar se bhar diya. Aur us ne meri baanhon ko charbi se bhar diya. Aur us ne mujhey khush kya aur mera dil khush hua. Us ne mujhey bakriyon walon mein paaya. To us ne mujhey ghodey aur oont walon aur anaaj katney aur saaf karney walon mein bana diya. To uskey paas main kehti hun aur mujhey bura nahi kaha jaata. Aur main soti hun aur subah tak (soti hun). Aur main peeti hun aur seeraab hoti hun. Abu Zara ki maan! To Abu Zara ki maan kya hai? Uskay bartan bharey huey hain. Aur uska ghar kushaada hai. Abu Zara ka beta! To Abu Zara ka beta kya hai? Uska bistar talwaar khenchney jaisa hai. Aur use bakri key bachchey ka baazu seer karta hai. Abu Zara ki beti! To Abu Zara ki beti kya hai? Apne baap ki itaat karney wali. Aur apni maan ki itaat karney wali. Aur apne kapdey ko bharney wali. Aur apni padosan ko ghussa dilaane wali. Abu Zara ki londi! To Abu Zara ki londi kya hai? Wo hamaari baat ko nahi phailaati. Aur wo hamaarey toshay ko nahi bigaadti. Aur wo hamaarey ghar ko kachra kundaan nahi banaati. Unhon-ne kaha: Abu Zara nikla jab doodh key mashkeeze biloay jaa rahey they. To wo aurat se mila jiskay sath uskey do betey cheeton jaisey they. Wo uski kamar key neechey do anaaron se kheltey they. To us ne mujhey talaaq di aur us se nikaah kya. To main ne uskey baad shareef aadmi se nikaah kya. Wo tez ghodey par sawaar hua. Aur nezah liya. Aur bahut maal mujh par lauta diya. Aur mujhey har aaney wali mein se joda diya. Aur kaha: Khaao ae Umm Zara! Aur apne ghar walon ko do! Unhon-ne kaha: Phir agar main sab jama karun jo us ne mujhey diya hai to wo Abu Zara key chhotey bartan tak na pahunchega. Aisha ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tumhaarey liye Abu Zara ki Umm Zara jaisa tha. (Bukhari: 5189)"
"1860","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat key liye halaal nahi hai ke wo roza rakkhey jabke uska shohar haazir ho magar uski ijazat se. Aur wo uskey ghar mein ijazat na dey magar uski ijazat se. Aur jo kharch us ne kharch kya uskey hukm key baghair to wo uski taraf aadha lautaya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 5195)"
"1861","[AI-translation] Usaama (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main Jannat key darwaazay par khada hua. To aam jo us mein daakhil huey miskeen they. Aur maal waley rokay gaey. Siwa iskey ke aag walon ko aag ki taraf hukm diya gaya tha. Aur main aag key darwaazay par khada hua. Phir aam jo us mein daakhil huin auratein thein. (Bukhari: 5196)"
"1862","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab nikaltey to apni biwiyon key darmiyaan qura daaltey. To qura Aisha aur Hafsa key liye nikla. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat mein hotey to Aisha key sath chaltey aur baat kartey. To Hafsa ne kaha: Kya tum aaj raat mera oont sawaar na hogin aur main tumhaara oont sawaar hungi. Tum dekho aur main dekhun. To unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. To wo sawaar huin. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Aisha key oont key paas tashreef laaey jabke us par Hafsa thein. To Aap ne unhey salaam kya. Phir chaley yahan tak ke utrey. Aur Aisha ne Aap ko gum paaya. Phir jab wo utrey to unhon-ne apney donon paon izkhir mein rakkhey. Aur kehten: Ae merey Rab! Mujh par bichchu ya saanp musallat farma jo mujhey kaatey. Aur main us se kuchh keh nahi sakti. (Bukhari: 5211)"
"1863","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Sunnat hai ke jab kunwaari se nikaah karey to uskey paas saat thehrey. Aur jab bewa se nikaah karey to uskey paas teen thehrey. (Bukhari: 5213)"
"1864","[AI-translation] Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aurat ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri sautan hai. To kya mujh par gunaah hai agar main apne shohar se uskey siwa se seer hun jo wo mujhey deta hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo uskey sath seer hai jo use nahi diya gaya wo jhoot key do kapdey pehen-ney waley jaisa hai. (Bukhari: 5219)"
"1865","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ghairat karta hai. Aur Allah ki ghairat hai ke momin aaey jo Allah ne haraam kya hai. (Bukhari: 5223)"
"1866","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr ki beti Asma (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujh se Zubair ne nikaah kya jabke zameen mein uska maal aur na ghulaam aur na kuchh tha, siwa paani bharney waley oont key aur uskey ghodey key. To main uskey ghodey ko chaara daalti aur paani bharti aur uski mashk seeti aur aata goondhti. Aur main roti pakana achhi tarah nahi jaanti thi. Aur meri Ansaar mein padosanein roti pakaaten. Aur wo sachi auratein theen. Aur main Zubair ki zameen se guthliyaan uthaaten jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use dee thi, apne sar par. Jabke wo mujh se do tihaai farsakh par thi. To main aik din aai jabke guthliyaan merey sar par thein. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mili jabke Aap key sath Ansaar mein se giroh tha. To Aap ne mujhey bulaaya. Phir farmaya: Ikh ikh! Taake mujhey apne peechey sawaar karein. To main mardon key sath chalney se sharmai. Aur Zubair aur uski ghairat yaad ki. Jabke wo logon mein sab se ghairat wala tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jaan liya ke main sharmai hun aur Aap aagey badh gaey. To main Zubair key paas aai aur main ne kaha: Mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) milay jabke merey sar par guthliyaan thein jabke Aap key sath Aap key sahaaba mein se giroh tha. To Aap ne sawaari bithaai taake main sawaar hun aur main Aap se sharmai. Aur tumhaari ghairat jaani. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam tumhaara guthliyaan uthaana mujh par tumhaarey uskey sath sawaar honay se zyada sakht tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Yahan tak ke Abu Bakr ne uskey baad merey paas khaadim bheja jo mujhey ghodey ki siyaasat mein kaafi ho. To goya us ne mujhey aazaad kar diya. (Bukhari: 5224)"
"1867","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Beshak main jaanta hun ke tum mujh se raazi ho aur ke tum mujh par ghussa ho. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Tum use kahaan se jaantey ho? To Aap ne farmaya: Lekin jab tum mujh se raazi hotin to beshak tum kehtin ho: Nahi, Muhammad key Rab ki qasam! Aur jab tum mujh par ghussa hotin to kehtin ho: Nahi, Ibrahim key Rab ki qasam! Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Main sirf tumhaara naam chhorti hun. (Bukhari: 5228). Miswar bin Makhrama se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmatey huey suna: Beshak Hishaam bin Mugheera key betey ne ijazat maangi hai ke wo apni beti ka Ali bin Abi Taalib se nikaah karein. To main ijazat nahi deta, phir ijazat nahi deta, phir ijazat nahi deta. Magar ye ke Abu Taalib ka beta chaahey ke wo meri beti ko talaaq dey aur unki beti se nikaah karey. Beshak wo mera tukda hai. Mujhey shak mein daalta hai jo use shak mein daaley aur mujhey takleef deta hai jo use takleef dey. Aap ne aisa kaha. (5230). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1868","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Auraton par daakhil honay se bacho. To Ansaar mein se aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Devar key baarey mein tumhaari kya raey hai? Aap ne farmaya: Devar maut hai. (Bukhari: 5232)"
"1869","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat aurat se lipat kar na milay aur wo use apne shohar ko bataaey goya wo use dekhta hai. (Bukhari: 5240)"
"1870","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) naapasand kartey they ke aadmi apne ghar walon key paas raat ko aaey. (Bukhari: 5243)"
"1871","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Jaabir Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum raat ko daakhil ho to apne ghar walon par daakhil na ho yahan tak ke ghaaeb rehne wali zer-e-naaf baal saaf karey aur bikhrey baalon wali kangha karey. (Bukhari: 5246). Talaaq ki kitaab."
